[en.FOCUS_C07_LPGG_GAMBLE]
Gambling Popularization

[en.FOCUS_C07_LPGG_GAMBLE_desc]
Picture this: a colossal trillion-coin business cooperation project that beckons individuals seeking a financial windfall or those plagued by unemployment.\nSo attention all citizens who need or want a great fortune, don’t miss out a chance on investing in the Flim and Flam’s Las Pegasus Consortium as well as the Las Pegasus government supported entertainment industry.\nTo participate in such financial investment, all you need to do is to find a nearest hotel that is affiliated with the Las Pegasus Consortium and purchase a ticket, change your money ready to be invested into a thing called “chips”, and place some on a random table in th hotel, and then you are part of a trillion-coin business cooperation project! Isn’t that amazing?

[zh.FOCUS_C07_LPGG_GAMBLE]
博彩大众化

[zh.FOCUS_C07_LPGG_GAMBLE_desc]
试想一下：一个巨大的万亿金币价值的商业合作项目，吸引了那些寻求财富或者饱受失业之苦的个体。\n所以，所有需要或者想要巨量财富的公民们，不要错过投资于油嘴滑舌的洛马基财团以及洛马基政府支持的娱乐产业的机会。\n要参与这样的金融投资，你所需要做的就是找到一个与洛马基财团有关的酒店，购买一张门票，准备好要投资的钱换成一种叫做“筹码”的东西，然后在酒店的某个随机桌子上放一些，然后你就成为了一个万亿金币价值的商业合作项目的一部分了！这不是很神奇吗？

